Freedom Decision Kernel (FDK)
=============================

Engineering author: Ali Pourrahim <Alipourrahim.ap@gmail.com>
                    https://github.com/Aliipou

This software is an engineering encoding of the *decision layer* of the
philosophical work:

    نظریه آزادی، ایران و دین  (Theory of Freedom, Iran and Religion)
    Author: Mohammad Ali Jannat Khah Doust
    Licensed CC BY 4.0.

The axioms (A1–A7), consent logic, justice constraints, and the Mahdavi compass
originate in that work and are attributed to its author. The code, structure, and
engineering are by Ali Pourrahim. The two attributions are kept separate and must
not be merged: philosophy = Jannat Khah Doust; engineering = Ali Pourrahim.

This project does NOT claim that the property-rights axiomatic approach is proven
superior to other AI-alignment or formal-ethics methods. See README.md
("What it does NOT claim").

Relationship to AuthGate: this is the legitimacy layer that sits ABOVE
authorization. AuthGate (the capability/enforcement kernel) is a separate project
and is the downstream enforcer; it is not modified or included here.
